00:47:35.990 --> 00:47:40.030
All these people were not participating in
politics before 2016.

00:47:40.030 --> 00:47:43.170
They appeared in 2016.

00:47:43.170 --> 00:47:48.990
And then in 2018, some of them voted in the
midterms.

00:47:48.990 --> 00:47:54.650
And then in 2020, they were still around and
trying to get Trump reelected and now Trump's

00:47:54.650 --> 00:47:55.650
gone.

00:47:55.650 --> 00:48:00.040
And there's a real question as to do these
Trumps vote in midterms where now Trump isn't

00:48:00.040 --> 00:48:04.750
