00:48:09.660 --> 00:48:11.760
just kind of go back to whatever they were
doing before?

00:48:11.760 --> 00:48:14.340
I don't know what that is, but it didn't include
voting.

00:48:14.340 --> 00:48:15.800
We don't know the answer to that.

00:48:15.800 --> 00:48:22.490
But it's potentially something that will really
change the makeup of the 2022 midterm electorate.

00:48:22.490 --> 00:48:24.160
So do I have a definitive answer?

00:48:24.160 --> 00:48:25.280
I don't.

00:48:25.280 --> 00:48:31.020
But when we see Republicans were winning every
generic ballot three months ago, Democrats

00:48:31.020 --> 00:48:33.130
are now winning every generic ballot.

00:48:33.130 --> 00:48:35.970
That is a major change and potentially significant.

00:48:35.970 --> 00:48:42.150
